<section class="grid"><article><p class="kicker">BUSINESS ENTITY</p><h2>Structured once. Reused everywhere.</h2><dl><div><dt>Name</dt><dd>Чайка Store</dd></div><div><dt>Location</dt><dd>вул. Валерія Лобановського, 21/3, Чайки, Київська область, 08135</dd></div><div><dt>Phone</dt><dd>+380 63 924 22 22</dd></div><div><dt>Hours</dt><dd>Mon–Sat 10:00–19:00 · Sun 10:00–18:30</dd></div><div><dt>State</dt><dd>UNCLAIMED → CLAIMED → CLIENT</dd></div></dl></article><article><p class="kicker">CHANNELS</p><h2>Public sources</h2><div class="links"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/chayka_store1" target="_blank">Repair Instagram ↗</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/more_chau" target="_blank">Tea Instagram ↗</a><a href="https://t.me/more_chay" target="_blank">Tea Telegram ↗</a></div><p class="note">Owner credentials are not stored on this public preview. Private access activates only after verification.</p></article></section>
